# Where the enquiry form POSTs its JSON.
# Defaults to /api/contact: the Vercel function in api/contact.ts on bramwell.top,
# and the Sites Worker in sites/worker.js on the Freebuff preview.
# Set this only to point the form at a different service (Formspree, Basin).
VITE_CONTACT_ENDPOINT=

# --- Delivery (server side only, never in the bundle) -----------------------
# Set these in Vercel -> Settings -> Environment Variables for bramwell.top,
# and in Sites -> Secrets for the preview.
# RESEND_API_KEY   secret   Resend API key. Without it the form reports that it
#                           is not connected instead of pretending to send.
# CONTACT_TO       var      Inbox that receives enquiries. Default: hello@bramwell.top
# CONTACT_FROM     var      Verified sender. Default: Bramwell Enquiries <enquiries@mail.bramwell.top>
#                           mail.bramwell.top is the domain verified in Resend.
#                           Every enquiry is blind-copied to team@mail.bramwell.top.

# --- Rate limiting (server side) --------------------------------------------
# Without these the throttle is per-instance: a cold function or a fresh Worker
# isolate starts its count from zero, so a determined sender can exceed the cap.
# Create a Redis database at upstash.com and copy the REST URL and token.
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_URL    var
# UPSTASH_REDIS_REST_TOKEN  secret

# --- Bot challenge (optional, but recommended once traffic arrives) --------
# Create a Turnstile widget at dash.cloudflare.com -> Turnstile. Both values
# come from the same widget; the site key is public and goes in the bundle.
# Without VITE_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY no widget is rendered and the server skips
# the check, so the form keeps working on its other defences.
# VITE_TURNSTILE_SITE_KEY   var     public site key
# TURNSTILE_SECRET_KEY      secret  server-side verification key
